# Computational Validation and Refinement of P14TCL1, an Oncogene Product Involved in T-cell Prolymphocytic Leukemia

---

# Overview

Select an oncology-related PDB structure; perform a pre-validation analysis using ERRAT, PROCHECK, and Verify3D; refine it with GalaxyRefine; perform a post-validation of the refined structure; and then quantitatively compare quality metrics and interpret the results in an oncology research context.

# Workflow

Select the Protein Structure
        ↓

Retrieve the Raw PDB Structure
        ↓

Inspect the Raw Structure
        ↓

Pre-Refinement Validation (ERRAT, PROCHECK and Verify3D)
        ↓

Prepare the Pre-Validation Results
        ↓

Identify Structural Quality Issues
        ↓

Structure Refinement Using GalaxyRefine
        ↓

Post-Refinement Validation
        ↓

Compile Post-Refinement Results
        ↓

Pre- vs Post-Refinement Comparison
        ↓

Structural Visualization
        ↓

Oncology-Based Structural Interpretation
        ↓

Assess Suitability for Downstream Research
        ↓

Final Scientific Conclusion

